+		 * heap) -- if THIS opens, container creation works and the phone's own container
+		 * properties are the refusal; if it fails too, containers cannot be created at all
+		 * in this DSP boot (heap/thread) */
+		for (unsigned variant = 0; variant < 2; variant++) {
